[00:16.460]The empty skies were full of grey
{"空荡天际布满灰蒙"}
[00:21.780]I wadded through the barren sea
{"我跋涉过荒芜之海"}
[00:27.380]Each step I take illuminates as darkness washes away
{"每一步都点亮光芒　驱散黑暗"}
[00:37.500]I'll color the world for you
{"我要为你染遍世界"}
[00:39.980]The skies and oceans too
{"还有天空与海洋"}
[00:42.740]A canvas of azure hue using every shade of blue
{"用所有蓝调绘出青碧画布"}
[00:48.020]Let's illuminate the night with vibrant shining light
{"让我们以璀璨光芒点亮黑夜"}
[00:53.980]So please don't let it be black and white
{"所以别让一切只剩黑白"}
[00:59.300]Cyanotype
{"蓝晒印相"}
